        "text": "\t← TOOL_RESPONSE get_user_information_by_name: Found 1 record(s) in 'users':\n\t  \n\t  1. Record ID: rp65a7b3c4\n\t     name: Riley Parker\n\t     user_id: rp65a7b3c4\n\t     address: 3847 Burnside Street, Portland, OR 97214\n\t     email: riley.parker@gmail.com\n\t     phone_number: 503-555-0293\n\t     date_of_birth: 07/19/1991\n\t  \n",
        "parent_source_id": "h11",
        "category": "HISTORY",
        "sha256": "86e2acecf60c9ddb9284b7853e344c59103a3a31aaefde9c29c7d2b00b1e0f37",
