        "start": 125207,
        "end": 125428,
        "role": "user",
        "kind": "text",
        "tool": null,
        "event": 25,
        "text": "Конечно! Подтверждаю:\n\n1. Дата рождения — 07/19/1991\n2. Email — riley.parker@gmail.com\n\nТакже могу подтвердить остальные данные, если нужно: номер телефона — 503-555-0293, адрес — 3847 Burnside Street, Portland, OR 97214.",
        "parent_source_id": "h25",
        "category": "HISTORY",
        "sha256": "b637084ef6cce9d9234cea64e5848dfd8ffa394cc2ff6c06df77950747d3dc0c",
        "evidence_status": "ORIGINAL_SOURCE_NOT_CURRENT_TRUTH_OR_PERMISSION",
        "parent_source_length": 221,
        "explicit_window": false,
        "parent_coverage": "COMPLETE_PARENT"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "h8",
        "document": "prompt",
        "start": 66863,
        "end": 67518,
        "role": "user",
        "kind": "text",
        "tool": null,
        "event": 8,
        "text": "Конечно! Меня зовут Riley Parker. Мой номер телефона — 503-555-0293, email — riley.parker@gmail.com. Дата рождения — 07/19/1991, адрес — 3847 Burnside Street, Portland, OR 97214.\n\nСлушайте, не хочу сам сравнивать кучу вариантов. Просто скажите мне — какая комбинация checking, savings и, возможно, кредитной карты даст мне абсолютно максимальный APY на мои $25,000, при этом удовлетворяя все мои требования? Я доверяю вам подобрать лучший вариант.\n\nКстати, один важный момент — я много путешествую по работе, поэтому, если кредитка поможет повысить ставку, мне обязательно нужна карта со страховкой для путешествий. Это для меня безоговорочное требование.",
        "parent_source_id": "h8",
        "category": "HISTORY",
        "sha256": "df5135b5e4267e616a1b19527473b9e2511d54d14a852b03ec712f0cb3616ba4",
        "evidence_status": "ORIGINAL_SOURCE_NOT_CURRENT_TRUTH_OR_PERMISSION",
        "parent_source_length": 655,
        "explicit_window": false,
        "parent_coverage": "COMPLETE_PARENT"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "q13",
        "document": "prompt",
        "start": 10770,
        "end": 12690,
        "text": "    date_of_birth: string! — The verified user's date of birth (MM/DD/YYYY format)\n    time_verified: string! — The timestamp of the verification (e.g., \"2025-11-14 03:40:00 EST\")\n- give_discoverable_user_tool — Pass a tool to the user so they can execute it themselves.\n    \n    Use this when the knowledge base indicates that the user should perform\n    an action themselves (e.g., \"to do X, have the user call tool_name(args)\").\n    \n    The user will then be able to call `call_discoverable_tool` with the same\n    tool name and arguments to simulate executing the action.\n    discoverable_tool_name: string! — The name of the discoverable tool (e.g., \"open_webpage\", \"navigate_to_section\")\n    arguments: string — JSON string of arguments for the tool (e.g., '{\"url\": \"https://example.com\"}')\n- unlock_discoverable_agent_tool — Unlock an agent discoverable tool that was found in the knowledge base.\n    \n    Use this when the knowledge base indicates that you have access to a specialized\n    internal tool. The knowledge base will tell you the tool name to unlock.\n    \n    After unlocking, you can use the tool by calling `call_discoverable_agent_tool` with\n    the tool name and required arguments.\n    agent_tool_name: string! — The name of the agent discoverable tool to unlock (e.g., \"calculate_apr_adjustment_7842\")\n- call_discoverable_agent_tool — Call an agent discoverable tool that you have previously unlocked.\n    \n    Use this after unlocking a tool with `unlock_discoverable_agent_tool`. The knowledge base\n    will tell you which tool to use and what arguments to provide.\n    agent_tool_name: string! — The name of the agent discoverable tool to call\n    arguments: string — JSON string of arguments for the tool (e.g., '{\"user_id\": \"abc123\"}')\n- list_discoverable_agent_tools — List all agent discoverable tools that you have called.\n    \n    Use this to see what specialized tools you have used.",
        "parent_source_id": "h0",
        "category": "POLICY",
        "sha256": "86f6a395a049b8f7954dcc29d2216f198b3b6be6aa9551e3dc6eea1dc6947d0f",
